        <mxCell id="p_note" value="&lt;b&gt;Physical-model note:&lt;/b&gt; The application code models Appointment → Payment as &lt;b&gt;hasOne&lt;/b&gt;, while the migration does not enforce a UNIQUE constraint on payments.appointment_id. The ERD reflects the application-level intended cardinality (1 : 0..1)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFDE7;strokeColor=#F9A825;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
